---
/* Cơm chiên cá mặn — Ụ CƠM BÁN CẦU úp chén kiểu tiệm người Hoa, vàng trứng (không vàng nghệ),
   lấm tấm vụn cá nâu + sợi gà xé nhọn hai đầu + hành lá; dưa leo lát + cà chua múi kề bên;
   đạo cụ: muỗng sứ cán ngắn + chén xì dầu ớt */
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 520 470" role="img" aria-label="Dĩa cơm chiên cá mặn ụ tròn vàng úp chén, dưa leo cà chua, kèm muỗng sứ và chén xì dầu">
  <defs>
    <linearGradient id="ccCom" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
      <stop offset="0" stop-color="#F0CB6A"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#CF9B3D"/>
    </linearGradient>
  </defs>
  <circle cx="260" cy="250" r="200" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.055)"/>
  <circle cx="260" cy="250" r="228" fill="none" stroke="rgba(242,214,138,.4)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="3 16" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <g class="steam">
    <path d="M196 210 C 185 186 211 170 200 144 C 193 128 207 116 203 102"/>
    <path d="M250 204 C 240 180 266 166 255 140 C 248 124 262 112 258 98"/>
  </g>
  <ellipse cx="260" cy="400" rx="200" ry="26" fill="rgba(15,26,14,.35)"/>

  <!-- dĩa -->
  <ellipse cx="260" cy="342" rx="204" ry="58" fill="#F6F1E1"/>
  <ellipse cx="260" cy="338" rx="204" ry="58" fill="#FDFAF0" stroke="#D8D0B6" stroke-width="2"/>
  <ellipse cx="260" cy="338" rx="204" ry="58" fill="none" stroke="#2C5234" stroke-width="4"/>
  <ellipse cx="260" cy="340" rx="168" ry="44" fill="none" stroke="#E0A32E" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="2 11" stroke-linecap="round"/>

  <!-- Ụ CƠM BÁN CẦU úp chén -->
  <ellipse cx="220" cy="332" rx="104" ry="20" fill="#A8781E" opacity=".3"/>
  <path d="M124 328
           C 124 272 164 236 220 236
           C 276 236 316 272 316 328
           C 316 340 277 347 220 347
           C 163 347 124 340 124 328 Z"
        fill="url(#ccCom)" stroke="#B0821F" stroke-width="2.6"/>
  <!-- vân hạt cơm phủ đều cả ụ, hai tông -->
  <g fill="none" stroke="#FAEBB4" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round">
    <path d="M186 254 q4 -4 8 0 M222 248 q4 -4 8 0 M252 262 q4 -4 8 0
             M162 278 q4 -4 8 0 M198 270 q4 -4 8 0 M236 276 q4 -4 8 0 M272 288 q4 -4 8 0
             M146 300 q4 -4 8 0 M182 294 q4 -4 8 0 M218 290 q4 -4 8 0 M254 302 q4 -4 8 0 M288 308 q4 -4 8 0
             M158 320 q4 -4 8 0 M196 314 q4 -4 8 0 M234 320 q4 -4 8 0 M270 326 q4 -4 8 0
             M178 336 q4 -4 8 0 M248 338 q4 -4 8 0"/>
  </g>
  <g fill="none" stroke="#A8781E" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".7">
    <path d="M204 258 q4 -4 8 0 M240 254 q4 -4 8 0
             M176 286 q4 -4 8 0 M214 280 q4 -4 8 0 M252 288 q4 -4 8 0
             M164 308 q4 -4 8 0 M202 302 q4 -4 8 0 M240 308 q4 -4 8 0 M280 318 q4 -4 8 0
             M186 326 q4 -4 8 0 M222 330 q4 -4 8 0 M300 322 q4 -4 8 0"/>
  </g>
  <!-- hạt cơm lú ra ở mép ụ cho silhouette "cơm" -->
  <g fill="#EFC966" stroke="#A8781E" stroke-width="1.2">
    <ellipse cx="128" cy="304" rx="4" ry="2.2" transform="rotate(-40 128 304)"/>
    <ellipse cx="139" cy="272" rx="4" ry="2.2" transform="rotate(-55 139 272)"/>
    <ellipse cx="167" cy="246" rx="4" ry="2.2" transform="rotate(-28 167 246)"/>
    <ellipse cx="272" cy="242" rx="4" ry="2.2" transform="rotate(22 272 242)"/>
    <ellipse cx="302" cy="264" rx="4" ry="2.2" transform="rotate(50 302 264)"/>
    <ellipse cx="312" cy="296" rx="4" ry="2.2" transform="rotate(60 312 296)"/>
  </g>
  <!-- sợi gà xé nhọn hai đầu, xếp chồng lớp -->
  <g fill="#F6E4B0" stroke="#CBA75E" stroke-width="1.3">
    <path d="M168 296 C 174 292 186 292 192 296 C 186 300 174 300 168 296 Z"/>
    <path d="M175 300 C 181 296 192 296 198 300 C 192 304 181 304 175 300 Z"/>
    <path d="M226 270 C 232 266 244 266 250 270 C 244 274 232 274 226 270 Z"/>
    <path d="M234 274 C 240 270 251 270 257 274 C 251 278 240 278 234 274 Z"/>
    <path d="M244 316 C 250 312 262 312 268 316 C 262 320 250 320 244 316 Z"/>
    <path d="M251 320 C 257 316 267 316 273 320 C 267 324 257 324 251 320 Z"/>
    <path d="M196 246 C 201 242 211 242 216 246 C 211 250 201 250 196 246 Z"/>
  </g>
  <!-- vụn cá mặn nâu lấm tấm -->
  <g fill="#7A4A22">
    <rect x="158" y="284" width="7.5" height="5" rx="2.2" transform="rotate(-14 161 286)"/>
    <rect x="206" y="262" width="7" height="4.6" rx="2" transform="rotate(10 209 264)"/>
    <rect x="246" y="292" width="7.5" height="5" rx="2.2" transform="rotate(-8 249 294)"/>
    <rect x="180" y="316" width="7" height="4.6" rx="2" transform="rotate(16 183 318)"/>
    <rect x="262" y="330" width="6.4" height="4.2" rx="2" transform="rotate(-12 265 332)"/>
    <rect x="218" y="242" width="6.4" height="4.2" rx="2" transform="rotate(8 221 244)"/>
    <rect x="288" y="300" width="6.4" height="4.2" rx="2" transform="rotate(-6 291 302)"/>
    <rect x="140" y="308" width="6" height="4" rx="2" transform="rotate(12 143 310)"/>
    <circle cx="192" cy="282" r="2.2"/><circle cx="232" cy="300" r="2.2"/>
    <circle cx="210" cy="326" r="2"/><circle cx="258" cy="252" r="2"/><circle cx="296" cy="330" r="2"/>
  </g>
  <!-- hành lá điểm xanh -->
  <g stroke="#5B8F3C" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none">
    <path d="M172 282 l9 -2 M216 270 l9 -2 M244 302 l9 -2 M188 322 l8 -2 M262 292 l8 -2 M228 254 l8 -2 M154 302 l8 -2"/>
  </g>
  <!-- vài hạt cơm rơi chân ụ -->
  <g fill="#EFC966" stroke="#A8781E" stroke-width="1.3">
    <ellipse cx="134" cy="350" rx="3.8" ry="2.1" transform="rotate(-16 134 350)"/>
    <ellipse cx="152" cy="356" rx="3.5" ry="2" transform="rotate(12 152 356)"/>
    <ellipse cx="308" cy="352" rx="3.8" ry="2.1" transform="rotate(-8 308 352)"/>
  </g>

  <!-- dưa leo lát xếp chồng chéo như xắt tới đâu ngả tới đó -->
  <g>
    <circle cx="338" cy="312" r="16" fill="#6F9C48" stroke="#4E7B36" stroke-width="2.2"/>
    <circle cx="338" cy="312" r="11" fill="#DCE9BC"/>
    <circle cx="360" cy="323" r="16" fill="#6F9C48" stroke="#4E7B36" stroke-width="2.2"/>
    <circle cx="360" cy="323" r="11" fill="#DCE9BC"/>
    <circle cx="382" cy="334" r="16" fill="#6F9C48" stroke="#4E7B36" stroke-width="2.2"/>
    <circle cx="382" cy="334" r="11" fill="#DCE9BC"/>
    <g fill="#F6FAEA">
      <ellipse cx="334" cy="310" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(-30 334 310)"/>
      <ellipse cx="342" cy="312" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(40 342 312)"/>
      <ellipse cx="337" cy="316" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(80 337 316)"/>
      <ellipse cx="356" cy="321" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(-30 356 321)"/>
      <ellipse cx="364" cy="323" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(40 364 323)"/>
      <ellipse cx="378" cy="332" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(-30 378 332)"/>
      <ellipse cx="386" cy="334" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(40 386 334)"/>
      <ellipse cx="381" cy="338" rx="2" ry="1.3" transform="rotate(80 381 338)"/>
    </g>
  </g>
  <!-- cà chua bổ múi cau (múi dày, thấy ruột + hột) -->
  <g transform="translate(372 320) rotate(-12)">
    <path d="M0 0 A 20 20 0 0 1 40 0 Q 20 15 0 0 Z" fill="#E23B2E" stroke="#B22B20" stroke-width="2.2"/>
    <path d="M5 0 A 15 14 0 0 1 35 0 Q 20 10 5 0 Z" fill="#F26A50"/>
    <g fill="#F6C888"><circle cx="14" cy="2" r="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="3.8" r="1.5"/><circle cx="27" cy="2" r="1.5"/></g>
  </g>
  <g transform="translate(390 350) rotate(10)">
    <path d="M0 0 A 19 19 0 0 1 38 0 Q 19 14 0 0 Z" fill="#E23B2E" stroke="#B22B20" stroke-width="2.2"/>
    <path d="M5 0 A 14 13 0 0 1 33 0 Q 19 10 5 0 Z" fill="#F26A50"/>
    <g fill="#F6C888"><circle cx="13" cy="2" r="1.4"/><circle cx="19" cy="3.6" r="1.4"/><circle cx="25" cy="2" r="1.4"/></g>
  </g>

  <!-- muỗng sứ cán ngắn kiểu tiệm người Hoa -->
  <g transform="translate(402 414) rotate(-12)">
    <ellipse cx="10" cy="12" rx="52" ry="11" fill="rgba(15,26,14,.3)"/>
    <path d="M22 -8 L 66 -16 C 74 -17.5 79 -12 77 -5 C 76 -1 73 1 68 2 L 24 8 C 20 4 20 -4 22 -8 Z"
          fill="#FDFAF0" stroke="#D8D0B6" stroke-width="2"/>
    <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="27" ry="17" fill="#FDFAF0" stroke="#D8D0B6" stroke-width="2"/>
    <ellipse cx="-2" cy="-1" rx="19" ry="11" fill="#EBE4CB"/>
    <path d="M-14 -5 A 15 8 0 0 1 8 -7" fill="none" stroke="#F8F4E4" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M30 -4 L 64 -10" stroke="#2C5234" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".8"/>
  </g>

  <!-- chén xì dầu ớt -->
  <g transform="translate(96 402)">
    <ellipse cx="0" cy="15" rx="44" ry="12" fill="rgba(15,26,14,.3)"/>
    <path d="M-36 -2 C -34 15 -19 24 0 24 C 19 24 34 15 36 -2 Z" fill="#FDFAF0" stroke="#D8D0B6" stroke-width="2"/>
    <ellipse cx="0" cy="-2" rx="30" ry="9" fill="#5A3418"/>
    <ellipse cx="-8" cy="-3.5" rx="12" ry="3.4" fill="#8A5A2E" opacity=".9"/>
    <circle cx="8" cy="-2" r="4.6" fill="#D64B33" stroke="#A83722" stroke-width="1.6"/>
    <circle cx="8" cy="-2" r="2" fill="#F28C6E"/>
    <circle cx="-16" cy="0" r="4" fill="#D64B33" stroke="#A83722" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    <circle cx="-16" cy="0" r="1.7" fill="#F28C6E"/>
  </g>
</svg>
